% formalizes: claim:ethics-a1
% claim: Axiom I: everything exists either in itself or in something else
% says: Everything which exists, exists either in itself or in something else.
% "Either in itself or in something else." Datalog derives no disjunction,
% so this reads: a thing that is not in itself is in something else. Adding
% the other direction too would make the program unstratifiable.
in_other(X) :- thing(X), not in_itself(X).
